<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Supplementary Table S1: Comparison of performance and geometric metrics between cylindrical (flatworld) and spherical (round-world) geometries. Values are means (top) with 95% confidence intervals (bottom). Paired Wilcoxon signed-rank tests compare matched repetitions (sphere minus cylinder).</figcaption>
</figure>
