<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Supplementary Table S2: Summary statistics across concept regimes defined by <math id="S6.T2.m178" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>. The upper block reports regime means with 95% confidence intervals together with the paired comparison between the frustrated (<math id="S6.T2.m179" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=1</annotation></semantics></math>) and consistent (<math id="S6.T2.m180" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=-1</annotation></semantics></math>) settings. The lower block reports paired Hodges–Lehmann median shift estimates with 95% confidence intervals and paired Wilcoxon signed-rank <math id="S6.T2.m181" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>-values for comparisons against the independent baseline (<math id="S6.T2.m182" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=0</annotation></semantics></math>).</figcaption>
</figure>
